<title>USA: Jacor Communications to buy Regent.</title>
<headline>Jacor Communications to buy Regent.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacor Communications Inc said Wednesday it reached a definitive agreement to acquire Regent Communications Inc.</p>
<p>Regent, based in Covington, Ky., owns, operates or represents 20 radio stations in five United States markets.</p>
<p>Jacor said it will acquire regent for 3.55 million newly issued shares of Jacor common stock, warrants to buy 500,000 shares of Jacor common stock at $40 per share and the assumption of Regent's $64 million debt.</p>
</text>
